{"ok": true, "result": {"created": 1791571540.2868555, "definition": {"defaults": {"model": "fixture-parallele", "provider": "codex"}, "description": "Votre parcours de release dans une conversation : recueil, plan, travail, contrôles et préparation de livraison. Chaque demande garde ses preuves.", "edges": [{"from": "intent", "id": "intent-plan", "mapping": {"intent": "intent"}, "outcome": "done", "to": "plan"}, {"from": "plan", "id": "plan-scope", "mapping": {"plan": "plan"}, "outcome": "done", "to": "scope"}, {"from": "scope", "id": "scope-work", "mapping": {"plan": "plan"}, "outcome": "approve", "to": "work"}, {"from": "work", "id": "work-check", "mapping": {"result": "result"}, "outcome": "done", "to": "check"}, {"from": "check", "id": "check-quality", "mapping": {"evidence_summary": "evidence_summary", "verdict": "verdict"}, "outcome": "done", "to": "quality"}, {"from": "quality", "id": "quality-delivery", "mapping": {"evidence_summary": "evidence_summary"}, "outcome": "pass", "to": "delivery"}, {"from": "quality", "id": "quality-failure", "outcome": "fail", "to": "failure"}, {"from": "delivery", "id": "delivery-receipt", "mapping": {"proposal": "proposal"}, "outcome": "done", "to": "receipt"}], "id": "release-conversation-mv1b8gof-mv1bab8j", "nodes": [{"id": "intent", "kind": "agent", "max_attempts": 2, "outputs": {"intent": "string"}, "position": {"x": 70, "y": 100}, "profile": "generalist", "prompt": "Clarifier parameters.request, ses critères, risques, inconnues et périmètre. Poser les questions manquantes. Ne pas développer pendant le recueil.", "title": "Analyser la demande", "validation": "contract"}, {"id": "plan", "inputs": {"intent": "string"}, "kind": "agent", "max_attempts": 2, "outputs": {"plan": "string"}, "position": {"x": 360, "y": 100}, "profile": "generalist", "prompt": "Préparer un plan proportionné, critères, dépendances, risques, étapes et méthode de vérification. L’express convient seulement à un défaut précis, réversible, sans droits, sc